Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Next", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.965628803425027*^9, 
  3.965628805211953*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"68fbbe85-7075-4f44-acfc-\
d85c041d5b90"],

Cell["\<\
1. Open dynamical systems category theory. This can provide some nice \
insights. Particularly, how to think of input/output?
2. Hopfield neural nets.
3. Some active programming?
4. Graph neural networks
5. A lot of literature to read.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.966401323350563*^9, 3.9664013467828493`*^9}, {
   3.966516748921508*^9, 3.966516749995021*^9}, {3.967101758540318*^9, 
   3.967101780957514*^9}, {3.967101839250598*^9, 3.9671018443219433`*^9}, {
   3.96710493944292*^9, 3.967104982245261*^9}, {3.967508992761573*^9, 
   3.9675089944609833`*^9}, {3.96750923578267*^9, 3.967509240733756*^9}, {
