https://www2.yukawa.kyoto-u.ac.jp/~future/icis/wp/wp-content/uploads/2015/02/\
2015-004-a.pdf\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.969431586815996*^9, 3.969431603570401*^9}, {
  3.9694399904902573`*^9, 
  3.96943999086784*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"43d787d0-ab15-4d20-82db-\
eb3beacd7834"],

Cell["https://arxiv.org/pdf/2504.17700", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.969440002921002*^9},ExpressionUUID->"a7ea683f-d4fa-4312-9156-\
67a3934b11f2"],

Cell["Dobocciboccihowthis@42 ", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.968913474363844*^9, 3.9689134957500877`*^9}, {
   3.968913532660156*^9, 3.968913549107918*^9}, {3.9689231171436462`*^9, 
   3.968923121317279*^9}, 
   3.969088038523283*^9},ExpressionUUID->"d797011b-b2c1-49c6-9ef8-\
5335157095b6"],

Cell["\<\
I want to make an AI that internalizes mathematical meaning in a way that a \
human mathematician does,  not just syntactically manipulates symbols. This \
means that it focuses on the higher order structure, not just the syntax.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.968571460341683*^9, 3.968571535393265*^9}, 
   3.968888238694705*^9},ExpressionUUID->"0b8ac0ee-5422-4761-b7e4-\
24c2759b2433"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "An initial proposal for the layers of understanding which builds up. Now, \
the whole problem is about focusing on the higher order structure and how to \
encode these things. Maybe we use causal structure to encode the existence of \
patterns, or a more relational way. Lack of randomness can be encoded in many \
ways, and a mental model should be flexible enough. Maybe \
it\[CloseCurlyQuote]s some sort of a recursive process. To process the random \
variable ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["X", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "49f86f92-323d-4d98-9284-db6eca1d0bbc"],
 ", we process the random variable ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"f", "(", "X", ")"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b4abf36e-bdc7-4cba-b527-a705f2200644"],
 ", and so on. So processing becomes somewhat easier because ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"H", "(", 
     RowBox[{"f", "(", "X", ")"}], ")"}], " ", "<=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"H", "(", "X", ")"}]}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "5dae8040-d839-45b8-8689-0604e463c8b3"],
 " for any random variable ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["X", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e889d0f7-7547-492a-8ddd-a30fa5bcdfe6"],
 ". "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.968572795747956*^9, 3.968572796032982*^9}, {
  3.968572834557472*^9, 3.968572862697522*^9}, {3.968888503131397*^9, 
  3.9688885285426493`*^9}, {3.968888768656077*^9, 3.968888830558217*^9}, {
  3.968908170084064*^9, 3.96890818138404*^9}, {3.968908226922807*^9, 
  3.968908266876157*^9}, {3.968911589123406*^9, 3.968911590413194*^9}, {
  3.968912121181525*^9, 
  3.968912121494581*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"f4632347-a11d-4c99-abb5-\
1df75cffeebb"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "1. Input later ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["-", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ad6bcf2e-6c6b-4474-ba60-a6454aad8581"],
 " raw Lean. In image recognition, the input for the human eye is physical \
light. For a computer, it is RGB data on the pixels. For mathematics, the \
input is gain physical light or something else, very complex. In the case of \
mathematics, the input can be lean code. This is raw sensory input. There can \
be many different layers of understanding as well. Seems like there is some \
reinforcement learning happening as well. In traditional Chat GPT there is an \
embedding layer and then the output is modelled as a function so then we have \
something else we can just put it through the function. Now, the question is \
whether the brains works like that in a sense or it is a reasonable thing. \
The brain has a set of knowledge. Then once it gets asked a question, it \
starts working  and seemingly referencing the knowledge state. We can think \
of this as the training aspect of the processing part when the brain learns \
the function on the embeddings. That can be thought of as a conscious brain. \
However, there might be some interaction between those layers."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->CompressedData["
1:eJxTTMoPSmViYGAQBmIQ/WTT5kKJSW8d3yc3lYLoLZ+/VoLotL0ZdSA6quVu
L4g+cWB7P4j+/PnTIxCtvDD3GYi+ZyX5GkT/t78FptM2JLBKAmkzll1sINor
pD8eRG9NPA2m00pm9oPoKaXzJoBokV/X34BoS47PYFpQ4/c3EM37R/w7iL4i
tUBSCkj3Gm8F00JGzzfxT37r2N15bTOI5pWZcRxEdwaxnAHRVwrO3QPRPupp
T0B0FvvcNyB6QcrTDyD6t9cfFQEgPb0hUA1Em94/qwWiX8r56IHoVXlzAkH0
ocONQSC6s8bORwlIn9i2BkwDANW9maE=
  "],ExpressionUUID->"6e3559a7-3b59-4f11-9f14-ba7ea92676c0"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Now obviously a huge part of this is finding the representation which will \
allow a nice input",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["-", TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "ff5ef678-c82a-4c62-9a83-ac922c87c781"],
 "output relationship. "
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.969430091457476*^9, 3.9694300944845967`*^9}, {
  3.969454700365959*^9, 
  3.969454710773715*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"6fde2f2e-dcf5-4f9d-97be-\
6fee48e5ea3a"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Definition ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "(Input data piece). An input data piece is a definition/theorem/lemma that \
we input into the system in lean code. The set of all input data pieces is \
denoted ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["\[ScriptCapitalM]", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "c66e766f-5743-4f68-b305-5f64f1875487"],
 "."
}], "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.968925057353464*^9, 3.968925075433436*^9}, {
  3.96892550260637*^9, 3.968925544054888*^9}, {3.968925826136413*^9, 
  3.968925872219177*^9}, {3.9693593392108912`*^9, 
  3.969359341594467*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"33d9f1a7-fe88-4e1b-b916-\
80c6a177ae31"],

Cell["The input data piece is typed for convenience. ", "Subitem",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.968925057353464*^9, 3.968925075433436*^9}, {
  3.96892550260637*^9, 3.968925552193212*^9}, {3.969354653762044*^9, 
  3.969354655438116*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"7619b102-5525-4385-9ac9-\
14f1aeb795c1"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Definition ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "(Knowledge category). It is a category ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["\[ScriptCapitalK]", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "207d8820-2c7e-44a5-ac87-f77424467103"],
 " with objects ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"ob", "(", "\[ScriptCapitalK]", ")"}], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"d9730ca8-9247-48a1-9510-bce97a648260"],
 " and morphisms are elements of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["\[ScriptCapitalM]", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "4dafa8ec-3850-40ab-bd6f-7be31a1ec570"],
 ". Basically, the idea is that the current state of knowledge is represented \
by an element and if it learns something the morphism is labelled by that. \
And obviously...it can learn anything...hmmm. Here, the identity morphism is \
labelled by the empty element in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["\[ScriptCapitalM]", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ae583b54-2016-46a8-97d0-912113ac312f"],
 " where it learns nothing."
}], "Item",
 InitializationCell->True,
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.968925057353464*^9, 3.968925075433436*^9}, {
  3.96892550260637*^9, 3.968925554223379*^9}, {3.968925631851144*^9, 
  3.968925706119936*^9}, {3.968925750384704*^9, 3.968925752223277*^9}, {
  3.968925874939961*^9, 3.96892588735154*^9}, {3.968925934511079*^9, 
  3.968925955214978*^9}, {3.968925993597217*^9, 3.968925994919438*^9}, {
  3.968926043449174*^9, 3.968926120834743*^9}, {3.969177336302785*^9, 
  3.9691773373210382`*^9}, {3.969417877763635*^9, 
  3.969417877764576*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"0bc9eac8-0524-4497-8b5c-\
d11aadeacc62"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Definition",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " (Subconscious mind). It consists of an embedding/representation of \
knowledge. It is a physical process, with forces of attraction/repulsion \
based on chemical reactions. This gives a huge blob of information."
}], "Item",
 InitializationCell->True,
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.968925057353464*^9, 3.968925075433436*^9}, {
   3.96892550260637*^9, 3.968925554223379*^9}, {3.968925631851144*^9, 
   3.968925706119936*^9}, {3.968925750384704*^9, 3.968925752223277*^9}, {
   3.968925874939961*^9, 3.96892588735154*^9}, {3.968925934511079*^9, 
   3.968925955214978*^9}, {3.968925993597217*^9, 3.968925994919438*^9}, {
   3.968926043449174*^9, 3.968926120834743*^9}, {3.969177336302785*^9, 
   3.9691773373210382`*^9}, {3.9694178781497*^9, 3.969417887555483*^9}, {
   3.969417950005468*^9, 3.969418001094521*^9}, {3.969418199650055*^9, 
   3.969418201340248*^9}, 
   3.969458690587567*^9},ExpressionUUID->"8a17a0c7-01fe-4ab0-aaab-\
b7f78587b980"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Definition ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "(Conscious mind). It is the part of the brain that acts on the knowledge \
stored in the subconscious mind to perform a certain task or in which the \
user has the notion of \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]I\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]. It \
is a separate layer that may influence the subconscious mind. "
}], "Item",
