7ed9cbd4170e"],

Cell["\<\
Now obviously a huge part of this is to find a nice representation of the \
Mathematical knowledge so that the processing/decoding later on becomes \
easier. Thus, we can have examples, and other organizational things so that \
there becomes a pattern of thinking or something.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.969430098531557*^9, 3.969430112105917*^9}, {
