  3.969426193538104*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5b6346b5-4a1e-475a-9350-\
88c2896ed7ce"],

Cell["\<\
The thing is that local to global questions seem useful over here.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9694265817128267`*^9, 
  3.969426589860301*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e9ae2037-e669-4722-af44-\
2914a6f0e2a1"],

Cell["\<\
Now, this seems very weird over here because it seems difficult of the engine \
will use this graphical structure to do mathematics. Imagine this graph grows \
in size and has all possible sorts of definitions and theorems or whatever. \
Then it is given a task of proving something related to something. That is \
the conscious brain, which might be thought of as a different sort of \
intelligence. In that case, we can perform a certain node embedding and learn \
a function on those embeddings. A certain model we can start with is that the \
subconscious mind is running in the background and the conscious mind is \
fighting for resources where we can \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]snap back to \
reality\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]. So for instance, if we are given a graph \
with knowledge and then the conscious mind steps in trying to solve a task or \
something. Then, if I go into the \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]set\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], then hmm. How does that search algorithm work?  \
Maybe there are different levels of thinking and many layers. Hmm. Who knows. \
let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s continue to explore. It\[CloseCurlyQuote]s merely a \
higher level of processing that occurs over here. Let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s see. 

But here, this also depends on the output...how we might encode such a thing? \
I don\[CloseCurlyQuote]t know how exactly this will work. However, this is a \
bit different from how Chat GPT works because once the subconscious structure \
is decided, the conscious structure produces the output. However, there is no \
reinforcement learning of some sort which can modify the subconscious \
structure again. Here, the training aspect is the. This is hard. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.969360489244357*^9, 3.969360507176803*^9}, {
