42a21e504c36"],

Cell["\<\
So the AI agent is fed the definition of a set. A set is a collection of \
objects. Now, what about graph neural networks? The idea is that we can have \
different layers. It will also be interesting to see how this works. Yes. We \
can look at graph neural networks and also how does google do all of those \
things.\
\>", "Text",
