BdJ8eza6g+hqpcogED3lnUU4iAYANYOodQ==
  "],ExpressionUUID->"cf744479-6485-45fd-951f-75218b5300de"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Now we can think of the search as it acting on. Doesn\[CloseCurlyQuote]t \
seem too promising. ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{"O", "(", "1", ")"}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "fd28c48a-0fa8-4208-9414-966f4628c810"],
 " search is give by some sort of a hash table. "
}], "Subitem",
 CellChangeTimes->CompressedData["
1:eJxTTMoPSmViYGCQAGIQ/cfRS7Wx763jZ/nrYDpo4gcLED3142xLEP2huW0n
iI7TW7gHRK9YkX4QRM/fG3MURG/suHYLRD+Y8uY2iE5jPf6oCUhXBKR8AtGd
