Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Note.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Here is another interesting idea: basically, the brain is good at forming \
associations and higher order structures. How are these related? Well, a \
higher order structure is something that collapses different things under the \
same domain. Thus, a lot of things under that domain are related i.e. \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]associated\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]. If the brain \
remembered every detail, it won\[CloseCurlyQuote]t be able to look at the \
higher order things because then similar things will appear different. "
}], "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->CompressedData["
1:eJwdxT1IAmEABmALpCUcaigJFYMgLKIMIyEHl8KgtKM/qCzKaoqgjOwy5LoQ
LbSElEBJKzKXJBfBsMEhhHBWsqFwKSTFNAnKoe91eHjEi+vUci2Hw+ETuKIc
bmPsOWVJlKpOOQr92PnlluMCa45gbddFFAcCqzHsfZh9xCFLMo3fTj9f8Ao3
ntknGzS6Iraq3b0sebI9K8NG66ECC9XjYzjf8zyBXZfJGRy0aY048Vs+wlm2
yYGTnncXtogaZAdkPe+8D7cwPpOP/BRWMXiv+2Pjiiyo+d7E/pu/bWzzR2g8
mPEwmBaU7bhion5w8/x9dalKrrgm86KhIbzbukNhTad1Cpu9d3O4sSNWfbRE
L+EB55kOU/xE/pYse01xg2TJFj09cpxTxk/qtFgqEa/h9IJaj+3FsAFbhPUs
/geDSNfe
  "],ExpressionUUID->"a261aba9-0b6c-4c10-b1ff-c574cbdab893"],

Cell["\<\
The problem is that such hazy data structures don\[CloseCurlyQuote]t exist \
mathematically or they might be the by product of some very crazy underlying \
structure. A pattern recognition agent should be able to \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]understand\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] the mathematics and \
see those things. In our brains, there is no clear picture and it\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]s just concepts and how they are related to each other. It \
will be very difficult to the demand that the AI \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]feels\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] the same way because we have engineer the hardware, \
and our \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]feelings\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] may be the \
computational boundedness of our soul, not the brain. So these are \
fundamentally different concepts. \
\>", "Subitem",
 CellChangeTimes->CompressedData["
1:eJwlyk0og3EAx/FRa+Ww8lJILCvFSF56RNlhF5pi8+StMGLeQspL5jFppjHa
