Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Note.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " How to keep \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]in my mind\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] that \
there is some goal and not get carried away into some random thought random \
walks? So does the model change over here? Does this mean that there is some \
control over the mind? Is this a consequence/foundation/axiom of a \
constructive model of intelligence?"
}], "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->CompressedData["
1:eJxTTMoPSmViYGAQBmIQHSIoEnq5961jSmkgmPaccrkQRE/64l8Ool+ZLKwB
