Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Note.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " How are thoughts \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]accessed\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \
if we start from initial thought. There are many collection of thoughts and \
then if an agent receives an external stimulus, then how does the brain \
access that thought related to that external stimulus immediately? Or is it \
that the external stimulus ",
 StyleBox["is ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "the starting point. "
}], "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->CompressedData["
