Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Note.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " There\[CloseCurlyQuote]s a reason why humans can\[CloseCurlyQuote]t \
remember an image pixel for pixel, or cannot do computations as fast as a \
calculator, or make mistakes. Seem that humans are good at knowing the higher",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["-", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "62ff4d41-fb60-4689-9ee6-08f4605119fa"],
 "level stuff and the pockets of reducibility. Thus, we are good at \
manipulating the structure of mathematics and find the patterns, but may not \
be good at a specific task. Is this related to compression of data and the \
brain focusing on the broader structure?"
}], "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9666715286271152`*^9, 3.96667153054558*^9}, {
   3.966671758611851*^9, 3.966671802498605*^9}, {3.966671845037709*^9, 
   3.966671942798354*^9}, {3.966672020242608*^9, 3.966672054870279*^9}, {
   3.96667233557206*^9, 3.966672337374854*^9}, {3.966672373666333*^9, 
   3.966672376612417*^9}, {3.966741292770586*^9, 3.966741293803418*^9}, {
   3.9667413245423813`*^9, 3.966741325480653*^9}, {3.966771412296574*^9, 
   3.966771460835639*^9}, {3.9667718026881647`*^9, 3.966771860054384*^9}, {
   3.966827911795401*^9, 3.966827960685045*^9}, {3.966828423989432*^9, 
   3.966828465617607*^9}, {3.9668290660102177`*^9, 3.9668290691357193`*^9}, {
   3.966830219218923*^9, 3.96683023479*^9}, {3.96683027800565*^9, 
   3.966830304135892*^9}, {3.966830433480348*^9, 3.966830452047871*^9}, {
   3.96683068248452*^9, 3.966830689409127*^9}, {3.966830906457363*^9, 
   3.966830934290921*^9}, {3.966831083958867*^9, 3.966831094687027*^9}, {
   3.966832010859826*^9, 3.9668321171461067`*^9}, {3.9668325336948752`*^9, 
   3.966832533929934*^9}, {3.9668326682734423`*^9, 3.966832668276486*^9}, {
   3.9668327745642147`*^9, 3.966832799112482*^9}, 3.966832887132189*^9, {
   3.966832974132104*^9, 3.9668329817530737`*^9}, {3.966833021752141*^9, 
   3.966833041255532*^9}, {3.966833338082069*^9, 3.966833408338781*^9}, {
   3.966834876437061*^9, 
   3.966834884099448*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"af8d7cee-1ea1-40ae-8cc9-\
3e4923002122"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Note.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Maybe a theory of algebraic dynamics will be useful over here.  Do we need \
an actual notion of weights etc.? Or we can do without it? Seems like there \
is some partial order approximation over here. "
}], "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->CompressedData["
1:eJxTTMoPSmViYGCQAGIQHSIoEnq5961jSmkgmPaccrkQRE/64l8Ool+ZLKwB
0XI9NztAdNHh9kkgOvjm7WkgOtDv004Qfe6f9i4QPSto6z4Q/XqG8H4QvWTF
jNSvIPGtO8G0QfTETBDdlLgeTHfWdkqx9L117Ns7SwFEF7GGeYPolr2NQSD6
bfHPDfJA+slr0e0gOm/l/w8guuCw8TcQvSXYwVEBSF8IXwKmsxnTL4Lode6R
l0G0p96BGyDaKpLlDohmjtd/A6I1OxrfgWiDRn9uRSA9SVyXB0TvWOSnDqKt
/E9qgWiu9XW2IFrhz1U7EL2pOXojiH6xZsk+EJ1js+0TiGY9tBdM38qbxawE
El80nRVECyc9O+gGpGU4mY+C6C+bH7P6AWnDgxAaAHtmxvE=
  "],ExpressionUUID->"19d23dd0-1208-437a-a05f-f7024c09bcd1"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Note.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Here, randomness/compression/quantum effects might be important. If the \
data about the thoughts were stored precisely, then it would be too \
important. Maybe here imperfection is the way to go about it. Maybe making \
things precise will prevent us being creative and stuck in those defined \
thoughts."
}], "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->CompressedData["
1:eJxTTMoPSmViYGCQBGIQHSIoEnq5961jSmkgmPaccrkQRE/64l8Ool+ZLKwB
0XI9NztAdNHh9kkgOvjm7WkgOtDv004Qfe6f9i4QPSto6z4Q/XqG8H4QvWTF
jNSvIPGtO8G0QfTETBDdlLgeTHfWdkqx9L117Ns7SwFEF7GGeYPolr2NQSD6
bfHPDfJA+slr0e0gOm/l/w8guuCw8TcQvSXYwVEBSF8IXwKmsxnTL4Lode6R
l0G0p96BGyDaKpLlDohmjtd/A6I1OxrfgWiDRn9uRSA9SVyXB0TvWOSnDqKt
