2746f7ca1305"],

Cell["\<\
Ideas seem connected in some way. As in should not be hard to make our own \
AI. Thing I\[CloseCurlyQuote]m debating is that all the other stuff is going \
to be useful too.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.966065430590907*^9, 3.966065434501751*^9}, {
  3.96606547571213*^9, 
  3.966065525659599*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"629b22c0-b452-4217-870d-\
1f9d56275c8e"],

Cell["\<\
Well, this might related to a GPT agent type world where it can teach. Maybe \
a digital human being? Hmm. I don\[CloseCurlyQuote]t know. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9660653519620323`*^9, 
  3.966065370621014*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"6fb498a3-29a3-4915-b5e7-\
