  3.9701153736192417`*^9, 3.970115396606205*^9}, {3.970115429285665*^9, 
  3.970115430862232*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"178770dd-4b88-4630-b5de-\
c098cbb875f1"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "There is a hyperplane separating some sort of groups from the other groups. \
Well, obviously, it will depend on the type of groups we are looking at over \
here. So there is some sort of top",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox["-", TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "d7e3af04-8494-4b5a-abd0-3aefc8f124f0"],
 "down mathematics giong on here."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.970115583786956*^9, 
  3.970115624866087*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"554d0795-bc75-4d3d-83df-\
453464046d31"],

